Subject: [PATCH 8/8] 5.0.0 draft, LOCAL ONLY (do not push before 5.0.0 ships):
 OPTION_C_PLAN S14, the report's 5.0.0 pages on the data file and tags pages.
 Generated-Reports describes the 5.0.0 report (its tabs, themes, filters,
 toggles, focus kept clear of the bar, tooltips and the parameter table);
 Report-Configuration its settings and start states; Report Themes (new) its
 colour tokens; Migrating to v5 (new) is the page for an upgrade, with one
 table of every 5.0.0 change and the setting that keeps the 4.x behaviour, one
 snippet, the data file's sections (kronikol-39's fragment) and pointers to
 Migrating to v5: the report (new) and Migrating to v5: tags; the sidebar and
 Home link them. Search-Syntax, Cross-Run-History, Merging-Parallel-Reports,
 Component-Diagrams, Diagnostics-and-Debugging, PlantUML-Browser-Rendering,
 Ingesting-External-Captures, Tags-and-Attributes,
 Tracking-Custom-Dependencies and Integration-ReqNRoll-xUnit3 say what 5.0.0
 changed for them. Checked against the code by an adversarial review, whose
 ten wording findings are fixed here (the eleventh, the empty state on a page
 without the report bar, was a code gap, fixed on v5 in a5e0ec91). Carried
 onto ddef9ff with three conflicts, resolved by row: the data file's rows and
 the attachments item as upstream and kronikol-39 wrote them, the history rows
 as S14 wrote them

