+  muted text, as in `1.3s · 1.2s warm-up`. Hovering the badge names the calls (`1.27 s, 1.19 s of it first-call
+  warm-up: POST /orders 661 ms (later calls 7.6 ms), GET /milk 82 ms (2.3 ms)`), and its colour is the one the time
